(3.2 Trust as conditional reliance) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ATG does not treat trust as a positive label or reputation score. Canonically, trust is) Tj
T*
(conditional reliance by one entity on another entity, assertion, output, dependency or) Tj
T*
(control for a defined purpose [ATG-12]. A material trust relationship should identify its) Tj
T*
(purpose, basis, scope, owner, transitivity rule if any, expiry, revocation and evidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
