T*
(not silently infer that A trusts C for the same purpose. Any such transitivity must be) Tj
T*
(explicit and constrained. This is particularly important in AI supply chains and provider) Tj
T*
(ecosystems, where inherited assumptions can otherwise become invisible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
