T*
(identity, application, agent, tool or workflow to access, influence or change a target) Tj
T*
([ATG-12]. A material authority assertion records the acting identity, capability, target,) Tj
T*
(scope, conditions, duration, approval, reversibility, telemetry and revocation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This model is useful for agentic systems because actionability can be amplified by) Tj
T*
(composition. A model that can only recommend is different from an agent that can invoke a) Tj
T*
(write-capable tool. An agent executing through a privileged service identity is different) Tj
T*
(again. The critical assurance question is therefore not simply "what can the model output?") Tj
T*
(but "what effective action can the composed system cause, under which identity and) Tj
T*
(controls?") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
