T*
() Tj
T*
(Reachability may be direct, indirect, chained, inherited, delegated or UNKNOWN [ATG-12]. A) Tj
T*
(path records a start condition, ordered traversal, conditions, boundary crossings, target,) Tj
T*
(controls, evidence and confidence, and any residual path after intervention.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The path is an explanatory object, not just a graph query result. If a consequential step) Tj
T*
(lacks evidence, the assessor must not invent the missing condition. The path remains) Tj
T*
(constrained by UNKNOWN until evidence or authorized testing resolves the question. This) Tj
T*
