T*
() Tj
T*
(Authority can be amplified when a downstream relationship increases reach, privilege, scale,) Tj
T*
(impact or autonomy. Several forms are especially important in connected AI systems: identity) Tj
T*
(amplification through inherited credentials; tool amplification when a reasoning component) Tj
T*
(gains access to a powerful action surface; data amplification when retrieval broadens) Tj
T*
(accessible information; workflow amplification when repeated or automated actions compound) Tj
T*
(effect; temporal amplification when standing permissions persist; and trust amplification) Tj
T*
(when one accepted assertion cascades into downstream decisions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
